job_description:
Position: Accounting Specialist (Evergreen Accounting LLP)
Responsibilities:
1. Review expense claims and post vouchers;
2. Support monthly reconciliation and tax filing paperwork;
3. Maintain vendor ledgers and follow up payments;
4. Prepare basic documents for audits.
Requirements:
1. Degree in accounting or finance;
2. Entry-level accounting certificate preferred;
3. Solid Excel skills;
4. Detail oriented and responsible.
